theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 20
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]HOW TO PLAY[/b]

[b]STREAMER[/b]
- Fly the ship with the arrow keys or WASD.
- Drag the radar window over the action. Creatures only show on the radar.
- Press [b]4[/b] for the thermal scan.
- Put the reticle on a creature and read the [b]RGN: <x, y>[/b] numbers.

[b]CHAT[/b]
- Fire a weapon with [b]!fire x y[/b], using the RGN numbers. It lands after 2 seconds.
- When the extraction code appears, type it [b]one character per message[/b], in order.
- Work together! If you input the wrong value, your team must start over!

If the creature reaches you, the ship will take damage, which will destroy the ship. Keep the ship alive. Extract to win."
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

